{"id": 1021, "title": "Birthday", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "birthday-story", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1021_birthday-story.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["今天是5月20日，好朋友的生日就要到了，时间过得真快。我不知道她准备做什么。但是我想她可以去杭州旅游。杭州很不错，我去过一次。从北京到杭州也不远，飞机火车都很方便。这肯定会是个特别的生日。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["今天是5月20日，好朋友的生日就要到了，時間過得真快。我不知道她準備做什麼。但是我想她可以去杭州旅遊。杭州很不錯，我去過一次。從北京到杭州也不遠，飛機火車都很方便。這肯定會是個特別的生日。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["jīn tiān shì 5 yuè 20 rì， hǎo péng you de shēng rì jiù yào dào le， shí jiān guò de zhēn kuài。 wǒ bù zhī dào tā zhǔn bèi zuò shén me。 dàn shì wǒ xiǎng tā kě yǐ qù Háng zhōu lǚ yóu。 Háng zhōu hěn bù cuò， wǒ qù guo yī cì。 cóng Běi jīng dào Háng zhōu yě bù yuǎn， fēi jī huǒ chē dōu hěn fāng biàn。 zhè kěn dìng huì shì gè tè bié de shēng rì。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Today is May 20, and my good friend’s birthday is coming up soon. Time flies! I don’t know what she’s planning to do, but I think she could take a trip to Hangzhou. Hangzhou is a great place—I’ve been there once. It’s not too far from Beijing, and traveling there by plane or train is easy. It would definitely make for a special birthday."], "english_full": "Today is May 20, and my good friend’s birthday is coming up soon. Time flies! I don’t know what she’s planning to do, but I think she could take a trip to Hangzhou. Hangzhou is a great place—I’ve been there once. It’s not too far from Beijing, and traveling there by plane or train is easy. It would definitely make for a special birthday.", "vocabulary": [{"word": "", "pinyin": "jīn tiān", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "shì", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "yuè", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "rì", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "hǎo", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "péng you", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "de", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "shēng rì", "translation": "